{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "659fa350-19e4-8048-8e58-a9a16436462a",
  "created_at": "2025-12-08T14:50:18-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Timothy Chase",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:44:18-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:44:24-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, I'm calling about water pooling at a storm drain at 200 Bellevue Avenue. It hasn't drained since the nor'easter Friday and Saturday, two days ago."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:44:37-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 200 Bellevue Avenue. Let me get that down. Is the water sitting in the street itself, or is it up on the sidewalk too?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:44:50-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mostly the street, right along the curb in front of the building. It's spread out into the lane, maybe twenty feet or so. Traffic is slowing to a crawl through it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:45:06-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Twenty feet or so of the lane, and cars are slowing down to get through. Is the drain itself visible? Can you see the grate, or is it covered by leaves or debris?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:45:24-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Sorry, I'm on speakerphone, I'm at the window. I can see the grate, it's partly covered with leaves and some branches. The water is just sitting there above it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:45:39-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so the grate is partly blocked with leaves and branches and the water's not going down. That's helpful. Has any of it gotten onto the property?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:45:53-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. A few inches of water seeped into the cellar. That's the first time that's happened in the years I've been in the house. I rent, so I told my landlord too, but I figured the drain is your department."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:46:13-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, the drain in the street is ours. A few inches in the cellar, first time since you've lived there. Let me note that. I'm sorry, you said a few inches, so not a lot of standing water now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:46:33-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[line breaks up] ...still some on the floor, yes. It's not rising, as far as I can tell. It went in Saturday night."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:46:45-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I missed part of that, the line broke up on me. Did you say it came in Saturday night and it's not rising now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:46:58-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Correct. Saturday night. It's holding steady."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:47:02-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thank you. Sorry, there was one more thing. I'm hearing some thumping on your end. Is that the line?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:47:13-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's my upstairs neighbor. His footsteps sound like a marching band. Anyway, it's not related."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:47:22-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I'll just keep going. I'll put in a work order for a crew to clear the drain at 200 Bellevue Avenue, flagged as water pooling in the roadway and into a cellar. Can I get your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:47:41-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Timothy Chase."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:47:43-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Timothy Chase. And is there a callback number in case someone needs to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:47:51-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0183."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:47:52-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me read that back. 401-555-0183. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:47:57-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:47:59-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. And the building is on Bellevue, number 200, in the Bellevue area, yes?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:48:07-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Bellevue Avenue, number 200."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:48:10-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. I've got it all in. I'll mark it as a priority because of the water getting into the cellar and the traffic."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:48:22-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Do the crews work on weekends? Because if this isn't cleared by then, it's going to be there all week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:48:33-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "After a storm they do sometimes have people out on weekends, but with a big one like this, they're working through a long list of drains. I'd expect someone within the next day or two, and I've noted the cellar so it moves up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:48:55-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Is there anything I should do in the meantime?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:49:01-05:00",
      "duration": 24,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "If you can do it safely, stay out of the water in the street. Please don't try to pull the grate up. If the water in your cellar starts rising, or you see it near anything electrical, call us back or call the non-emergency line right away."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:49:25-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I'll keep an eye on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:49:29-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And if a crew comes and clears it, but it backs up again, call and give us the same address so it gets linked to this one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:49:43-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Will I get a call when it's done?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:49:48-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Possibly. Sometimes the crew just does the work and closes the ticket, so I'd watch the street. If it's still pooled by Wednesday, call back and we'll follow up on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:50:04-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wednesday. Got it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:50:06-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Anything else I can help with this afternoon, Mr. Chase?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:50:12-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's it. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:50:15-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Take care."
    }
  ],
